ponents to expand state control and erode national sovereignty.","date":"2002","immediate_subject":"The political motivations behind the contemporary climate change movement.","intended_argument":"Environmentalism and climate alarmism serve as a convenient pretext for left-wing politicians to impose global regulations and undermine free-market capitalism.","research_confidence":"high","source_event":"Publication of her book 'Statecraft: Strategies for a Changing World'","verification_status":"composite"},"quote_text":"The doomsters' favourite subject today is climate change. Clearly no plan to alter climate could be considered on anything but a global scale, it provides a marvellous excuse for worldwide, supra-national socialism.","schema_version":1,"selected_image":{"basename":"t56.jpg","description":"Black-and-white archive photograph of a woman in formal pinstripe jacket, pearl necklace and earrings, speaking into a microphone while raising her right hand in a gesturing pose against a plain light wall.","image_hash":"6731ce7fd2770587f1a805c8f48c87b65cd3a37217f6b74d6eaa4c0b1b3d56e4","pairing":{"best_for_tones":["authoritative","serious","combative"],"best_for_topics":["leadership","government","parliament"],"general_reusability":65,"matching_summary":"Strong match for formal political oratory and authoritative statements; less ideal for informal, personal or light-hearted quotations.","semantic_specificity":55,"weak_for_topics":[]},"scene_types":["podium_speech"],"tone":["authoritative","serious"]},"v3_semantic_veto":{"quote_has_allowed_candidate_globally":true,"reason":"deterministic_neutral_portrait_policy","selected_status":"allow","veto_reason_codes":[]}}
